        <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate BitSize bits in the byte array where Bits contains the bits to set. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>AllocByteOffset is set to the offset within the byte array and AllocMask is set to the bitmask for those bits. This uses the LPT (Longest Processing Time) multiprocessor scheduling algorithm to lay out the bits efficiently; the pass allocates bit sets in decreasing size order. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
